# 1. How to Use This Guide

This document is written directly for Claude Code. It is the primary orientation document for the OPEX Budgeting System (OBS) implementation. Read it in full before writing any code. All decisions referenced here are final. Do not re-litigate architecture, terminology, or design decisions — consult the Project Context Handoff v2.4 if you are uncertain whether a decision has been made.

## 1.1 Document Hierarchy

The following documents collectively define what to build and how to build it. Consult them in this order when you need detail on any topic:

