| **Security and Access Control Specification** | v1.4 | Capability flag model, cost center grant model, request authorization flow (7 steps), audit events, error response standards. Every API endpoint must implement this. |
| **UX and UI Specification** | v1.5 | All screens, navigation model, MUI component choices, interaction patterns, acceptance criteria for all UX behaviours. |
| **Data Integration Specification** | v1.6 | File format contracts, ingestion pipeline, PostgreSQL schemas for dimensions and actuals, quarantine and re-promotion rules. |
